<title>Italy: Mediobanca year profits down, dividend steady. [CORRECTED 17:00 GMT]</title>
<headline>Mediobanca year profits down, dividend steady. [CORRECTED 17:00 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ending June 30.</p>
<p>(In billion lire unless stated)</p>
<p>Parent company results</p>
<p>    Parent net profit	  120.3 vs 155.1</p>
<p>(Corrects from Consolidated net profit)</p>
<p>    Ordinary dividend     200 lire vs 200 lire</p>
<p>    Gross operating profit   756.1 vs up 17.2 pct</p>
<p>    Net interest income	845.6 vs up 16.6 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Italian merchant bank Mediobanca SpA said its investment securities portfolio showed a fall in value of 25.2 billion lire after a decline in value of 75.2 billion lire in the previous year.</p>
<p>Consolidated results</p>
<p>    Net profit		   228   vs 199.6</p>
<p>    Shareholders' equity   4,727.3 vs 4,626.8</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129502</p>
</text>
